Source: ipdbg
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Daniel Anselmi <danselmi@gmx.ch>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, pkgconf, libserialport-dev, libwxgtk3.2-dev, swig, python3-dev, octave-dev | liboctave-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/IPDBG/IPDBG
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ipdbg-ioview
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: IoView: read and set signals of an IPDBG IoProbe core
 IoView is the GUI for the IoProbe core of IPDBG, the debugger for FPGAs:
 it shows the probe inputs as LEDs and sets the probe outputs.

Package: ipdbg-uartbridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: UartBridge: TCP to serial port bridge for the IPDBG UART transport
 UartBridge forwards a TCP port to a serial port, so the host tools of IPDBG,
 the debugger for FPGAs, reach a core over the UART transport.

Package: libipdbg0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: IPDBG BusAccess and WaveformGenerator libraries
 The libraries libipdbg-busaccess (register accesses through an IPDBG bus
 master core) and libipdbg-waveformgenerator (control of the IPDBG waveform
 generator core). IPDBG is a debugger for FPGAs.

Package: libipdbg-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libipdbg0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files of the IPDBG libraries
 Headers and pkg-config files of libipdbg-busaccess and
 libipdbg-waveformgenerator. IPDBG is a debugger for FPGAs.

Package: python3-ipdbg
Section: python
Architecture: any
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Python bindings of the IPDBG libraries
 Python modules BusAccess and WaveformGenerator for the bus master and
 waveform generator cores of IPDBG, the debugger for FPGAs.

Package: octave-ipdbg
Section: math
Architecture: any
Depends: octave, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GNU Octave bindings of the IPDBG libraries
 GNU Octave modules BusAccess and WaveformGenerator for the bus master and
 waveform generator cores of IPDBG, the debugger for FPGAs.
